From 3b2a13519508cf80f7153e22c6291deccf19ad9d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 02:18:26 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] Campus doctrines slice 2: facets, school seats, the Crucible
 of Storms

- Facets (partial shards): eternal flags facet_<school>_<source>; state sweep for survey/gate/sanctum/seat; blight facet sited beside a corrupted kingdom's zone and retrieved by a field party
- School seats: Building.IsSchoolSeat, BuildingTier.RequiredFacets; T1 gated by declaration, T2/T3 by 3/5 facets; the timeline's own school seat is chartered free
- Crucible of Storms: Fronts, Standing Weather, Monoelement or Confluence doctrine
- School Seats panel; construction gate unified in CannotBuildReason; debug facet grant; save asserts

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RF7HNp6pvyXiAz229q52Px
